<title>USA: Ryder says strikes hurt carrier services.</title>
<headline>Ryder says strikes hurt carrier services.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ryder System Inc said on Tuesday its Automotive Carrier Services' 1996 performance was hurt by the effects of two strikes suffered during the year.</p>
<p>The company said that Ryder Transportation Services' 1996 results were hurt primarily by lower commercial truck rental revenue and margins.</p>
<p>In response to continued weak demand for rental trucks, the business unit has reduced the size of its commercial truck rental fleet by more than 12 percent.</p>
</text>
